5,1,1,talk,Minato,,I am a bit worried about the ground here. It has surprised us before.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,May,,I am curious about the long-term upkeep. Who pays for the maintenance after the ribbon is cut?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"I am concerned about how our past projects have aged. I want to see what the earlier works look like now, not just the plans.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Victoria,,"I am concerned about who will actually maintain this space. The groundskeeping rota is shrinking, and I need to know who is left to do the work.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"The ground doesn’t care about your pretty renderings. I need to know how the drainage and heat actually behave here, not just what the brochure promises.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, that sounds important. I am also worried about the digging. Who will do the earth-moving here?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,May,,"@Victoria, that is a fair point. I am looking at the upkeep ledger to see the real cost per hectare.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@May, I agree. The ledger will show the true cost. I will check the condition of the earlier works to see what actually lasted.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"@May, the ledger shows the money, but I need the people. I will check the groundskeeping roll to see who is actually available.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Minato, the earth-moving firms are a distraction. I am checking the drainage callouts and heat readings to see how the ground actually fails.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Shunichi, I see. I am still curious about the firms. I will look at the regional firms tendering for earth-moving.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,May,,"@Minato, the firms are just the tip of the iceberg. I am checking the volunteer groups to see if they can fill the staffing gaps.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Shizue,,"@Minato, the firms matter, but I am more interested in the people. I will look into the volunteer groups to see who truly cares for this place.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Shizue, volunteers are helpful, but they are not a permanent solution. I will check the bought-in services to see what external help is actually available.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Victoria, bought-in services are just a cost line. I am checking the timed counts of weekday crossings to see how people actually use the space.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Minato,,I will also look at the depot phasing notes. I want to see how the site is hoarded during the work.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,May,,I will also check the terms of the regional habitat fund. I need to know if that money is real or just a promise.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Shizue,,I will also check the record of the eastern avenue planting. I want to see if those trees are still standing and healthy after all these years.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Victoria,,I will also check the record of the eastern avenue planting. I need to see if those trees are still standing and healthy after all these years.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,I will also check the drainage callouts and August heat readings. I need to see how the ground actually fails under stress.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
